              as
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/schreiber/show/Local+prequantum+field+theory"} Local prequantum field theory
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#ExchangingFieldsForStructures"}
              translates in quantum field theory jargon to the statement that “All background structures are fields.” This is essentially the slogan of
              = succeed "." do
