          %h2#references References
          %h3#topological_cobordisms Topological cobordisms
          %p The original hypothesis (there called the “Extended TQFT Hypothesis”):
          %ul
            %li#BaezDolan95
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/John+Baez"}> John Baez
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/James+Dolan"} James Dolan
              = succeed "," do
                %em Higher dimensional algebra and Topological Quantum Field Theory
              %strong 36
              (1995) 6073-6105 &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.1063/1.531236"}> doi:10.1063/1.531236
              ,
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/q-alg/9503002"} arXiv:q-alg/9503002
          %p An extensive sketch of an approach to the formalization and proof of the cobordism hypothesis:
          %ul
            %li#Lurie09
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jacob+Lurie"}> Jacob Lurie
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %em
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/On+the+Classification+of+Topological+Field+Theories"} On the Classification of Topological Field Theories
              %strong 2008
              (2009) 129-280 &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "https://dx.doi.org/10.4310/CDM.2008.v2008.n1.a3"}> doi:10.4310/CDM.2008.v2008.n1.a3
              ,
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a{:href => "http://arxiv.org/abs/0905.0465"} arXiv:0905.0465
          %p Review:
          %ul
            %li
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Ishan+Levy"}> Ishan Levy
              \:
              %em Proof of the Cobordism Hypothesis
              (2020) &amp;lbrack;
              %a{:href => "https://ishanina.github.io/Talks/Proof%20of%20Cobordism%20Hypothesis/index.html"}> webpage
              ,
              = succeed "," do
                %a{:href => "https://github.com/ishanina/PublicWritings/blob/master/Talks/Proof%20of%20Cobordism%20Hypothesis.pdf"} github
              = succeed "&rbrack;" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/files/Levy-CobordismHypothesis.pdf", :title => "pdf"} pdf
          %p
            The comparatively simple case of
            = succeed ":" do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi n
                    %mo =
                    %mn 1
